      <tr><td>Idle background / closed-dock frames</td><td>0 / 0</td><td>0 / 0</td><td>Both remain event-driven; visible widgets still update their data.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Retained background mip pixels</td><td>48.0 MiB</td><td>12.0 MiB</td><td>4096×2304 becomes 2048×1152 for this 1920×1080 display. Icons remain 11.8 MiB; no local/online previews are retained. These counters are not RSS.</td></tr>
